  "question": {
    "text": "<p>How many of the following molecules are with non-zero net dipole moment,</p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>HCl</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>BeF</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>BH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>CCl</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Among the given molecules&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>BeF</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>CCl</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>BH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;has zero dipole moment.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>BeF</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;has linear structure and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>BH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;has symmetrical trigonal planar structure and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CCl</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;also has symmetrical tetrahedral structure.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>HCl</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>&nbsp;have&nbsp;non-symmetrical structure.</p><p>Hence, their net dipole moment is not zero</p>"
  }
}